#: beatstamp/ui/details.py:168
msgid ""
"A Bitcoin block named in the last checkpoint issued BEFORE this entry.\n"
"That checkpoint could not exist before the block was mined,\n"
"and the entry came after the checkpoint."
msgstr ""
